WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.546
Eight financial actions and three training hours describe

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:08.217
different work. Useful analysis preserves that difference.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.857
Begin with the scope. Check the period, the

00:00:11.857 --> 00:00:15.097
person or unit, and any filters before interpreting

00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:15.907
the results.

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:19.547
Read the unit and the financial action type

00:00:19.547 --> 00:00:22.787
beside the number. A dollar amount alone does

00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:24.812
not explain what was accomplished.

00:00:25.212 --> 00:00:28.168
Open the records behind a figure. Check whether

00:00:28.168 --> 00:00:31.124
the selected work supports the conclusion you were

00:00:31.124 --> 00:00:32.233
about to draw.

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:35.462
Change the period and watch the evidence change

00:00:35.462 --> 00:00:38.291
with it. An empty view tells you there

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.120
is no matching record here; it does not

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.534
prove no work happened.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:46.172
Check the scope, understand the unit, and inspect

00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:49.411
the evidence. Then decide what the number means.
